option.CANDLE_GLOW=Candle Glow
option.CANDLE_GLOW.comment=A soft warm glow around lit candles. 0 turns it off.
option.FLAME_FLICKER=Flame Flicker
option.FLAME_FLICKER.comment=Torch and lantern light breathes softly, a little livelier when the wind picks up. 0 keeps it steady.
option.WIND_SPEED=Wind Speed
option.WIND_SHEEN=Wind Sheen
option.WIND_SHEEN.comment=Soft light sheen where a gust bends the grass.
option.GRASS_TONE=Grass Tone
option.GRASS_TONE.comment=Cool green or warm meadow green for grass ground.
