option.CAUSTICS_STRENGTH=Caustics Strength
option.UNDERWATER_RAYS=Underwater Rays
option.UNDERWATER_RAYS.comment=Soft light shafts from the surface while diving. 0 = off.
option.GLASS_REFLECT=Glass Reflections
option.GLASS_REFLECT.comment=Sky sheen at grazing angles and a highlight streak on glass.
option.GLASS_REFLECT_STRENGTH=Glass Reflections
option.GLASS_TINT_LIGHT=Tinted Glass Light
option.GLASS_TINT_LIGHT.comment=Sunlight passing through stained glass takes its colour.
option.SHADOW_DIST_SOFT=Distance Softness
option.SHADOW_DIST_SOFT.comment=Shadows become softer further away. 0 = off.
option.NETHER_FOG=Nether Look
option.NETHER_FOG.comment=Banded Nether fog in the biome colour with rising embers.
option.END_FOG=End Look
option.END_FOG.comment=Violet End fog and a painted End sky with nebula bands.
