option.SUN_HALO=Sun Halo
option.SUN_HALO.comment=Glowing halo around the sun disk. 0 = off.
option.RAIN_STREAKS=Rain Mood
option.RAIN_STREAKS.comment=Darker, calm blue mood for night rain. 0 = off.
option.FOREST_RAYS=Forest Rays
option.FOREST_RAYS.comment=Stronger god rays in forests and under canopies.
option.FOREST_HAZE=Forest Haze
option.FOREST_HAZE.comment=Blue depth haze between trees. 0 = off.
option.FOLIAGE_CONTRAST=Foliage Light
option.FOLIAGE_CONTRAST.comment=Yellow-green sunlit tops and cool shade on grass and leaves.
