option.BIOME_SKY=Biome Sky Colours
option.BIOME_SKY.comment=The day sky takes on the colours of the biome: sandy haze in deserts, orange over badlands, icy blue over snow, grey-green over swamps, turquoise over jungles, pink over cherry groves.
option.CLOUD_SMOOTH=Smooth Far Clouds
option.CLOUD_SMOOTH.comment=Far cubic clouds get even shading, faded edge-on faces and a soft distance fade (no scratchy far clouds).
option.SOFT_GRASS=Soft Grass
option.SOFT_GRASS.comment=Very gentle soft grass: calmer grass tops, smooth gradients and soft contact shading. Nothing that draws the eye.
option.SOFT_GRASS_STRENGTH=Soft Grass Strength
