option.CLOUD_LOW.comment=Big, faster, softly lit clouds below the main layer. They cast soft shadows on the ground.
option.CLOUD_HIGH=High Cloud Layer
option.CLOUD_HIGH.comment=Thin, slow, wispy blocky clouds high above the main layer.
option.CLOUD_LAYER_SPEED=Cloud Layer Speed
option.RIM_LIGHT=Rim Light
option.RIM_LIGHT.comment=A very soft bright fringe on the outline of hills, trees and creatures when you look towards the sun or moon.
