option.VALLEY_FOG.comment=Calm low-lying fog layer that pools in valleys and over rivers.
option.VALLEY_FOG_HEIGHT=Valley Fog Height
option.VALLEY_FOG_HEIGHT.comment=Top of the valley fog layer (world height).
option.TEXTURE_CALM=Texture Calm
option.ENTITY_SOFT=Soft Characters
option.ENTITY_SOFT.comment=Mobs and players get soft two-tone cartoon shading with a brighter shade side. 0 turns it off.
option.FAR_SOFTEN=Far Soften
option.FAR_SOFTEN.comment=Distant blocks melt into soft, flat tones like a painted background. 0 turns it off.
option.TEXTURE_CALM.comment=Smooth cartoon textures: blocks keep their pattern but lose harsh texel noise.
option.HELD_LIGHT=Held Light
option.HELD_LIGHT.comment=A torch or lantern in your hand softly lights up the dark around you.
option.HELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Held Light Strength
option.HELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=How bright the light from a held torch or lantern is.
option.STYLISED_LAVA=Stylised Lava
option.STYLISED_LAVA.comment=Calm cartoon lava: a deep orange body with slowly drifting bright veins.
option.LAVA_BRIGHT=Lava Brightness
option.LAVA_BRIGHT.comment=How bright stylised lava is.
option.GOLDEN_RIM=Golden Hour Rim
option.GOLDEN_RIM.comment=At sunrise and sunset, mobs and players get a soft warm fringe along their outline.
option.GOLDEN_RIM_STRENGTH=Golden Rim Strength
option.GOLDEN_RIM_STRENGTH.comment=How strong the warm fringe on characters is.
option.FIELD_WAVES=Field Waves
option.FIELD_WAVES.comment=Soft silvery waves that roll across grass fields with each wind gust, in step with the swaying grass and wind lines.
option.PAINTERLY_FAR=Painterly Distance
option.PAINTERLY_FAR.comment=Far land melts into soft, brush-like patches like a painted background. 0 turns it off.
option.SKY_BRIGHT=Bright Sky
option.SKY_BRIGHT.comment=A bright, open day sky with a long smooth gradient and a luminous horizon.
option.CHAR_RIM=Character Rim
option.CHAR_RIM.comment=A soft light fringe along mobs and players, so they stand out like painted figures. 0 turns it off.
option.GRASS_GRADIENT=Grass Gradient
option.GRASS_GRADIENT.comment=Grass blades shade from dark roots to bright sunlit tips. 0 turns it off.
