option.INNER_FADE.comment=Distance where inner edges fade out.
option.OUTLINE_FADE.comment=Distance where outlines fade out.
option.OUTLINE_R.comment=Red part of the outline colour.
option.OUTLINE_G.comment=Green part of the outline colour.
option.OUTLINE_B.comment=Blue part of the outline colour.
option.CLOUD_PUFFY=Puffy Clouds
option.CLOUD_PUFFY.comment=The low cloud layer forms big, rounded, soft puffs instead of block cells.
option.CANOPY_RAYS=Sunbeams Through Trees
option.CANOPY_RAYS.comment=Long soft sun beams fanning out of gaps in the leaves when the sun sits behind trees. 0 turns them off.
option.WATER_PAINTERLY=Painted Water
option.WATER_PAINTERLY.comment=Brighter turquoise water with broad, soft brush-stroke highlights instead of thin lines.
option.WATER_PAINTERLY_K=Painted Water Strength
option.WATER_PAINTERLY_K.comment=How strongly the painted water look is applied.
option.MOON_HALO=Moon Halo
option.MOON_HALO.comment=A calm silver-blue glow and a faint wide ring around the moon on clear nights. 0 turns it off.
option.WARM_COOL=Warm Light, Cool Shade
option.WARM_COOL.comment=Sunlit faces lean a little warm and shaded sides a soft sky-blue, strongest when the sun is low. 0 turns it off.
option.MOUNTAIN_LAYERS=Layered Ridges
option.MOUNTAIN_LAYERS.comment=Far mountains fade into the haze in a few soft steps, so ridges read as calm stacked silhouettes. 0 turns it off.
option.DUSK_WATER_GLOW=Dusk Water Glow
option.DUSK_WATER_GLOW.comment=A broad, soft warm light spreads over the water toward the low sun at sunrise and sunset. 0 turns it off.
option.SOFT_STARS=Soft Stars
option.SOFT_STARS.comment=Stars are small soft round points with a faint glow that breathe very slowly. 2 shows a few more, 0 uses the classic dots.
option.RAINBOW=Rainbow
option.RAINBOW.comment=After rain, while the world is still wet, a soft pastel rainbow arcs across the sky opposite the sun. 0 turns it off.
option.SUN_SPOTS=Sun Spots
option.SUN_SPOTS.comment=Soft round spots of sunlight on the ground under leaf canopies.
option.SHORE_FOAM=Shore Foam
option.SHORE_FOAM.comment=A soft white foam line that slowly washes up and down the shore.
option.BOUNCE_LIGHT=Bounce Light
option.BOUNCE_LIGHT.comment=Soft warm light bounced from sunlit ground onto undersides and shaded sides.
option.AERIAL_PERSPECTIVE=Aerial Perspective
option.AERIAL_PERSPECTIVE.comment=Distant land fades softly paler and bluer into the sky, so ridges stack into calm layers.
option.GRASS_PART=Grass Parting
option.GRASS_PART.comment=Grass and flowers bend softly away around your feet as you walk through them.
option.CAVE_HAZE=Cave Glow Haze
option.CAVE_HAZE.comment=Soft glowing haze around lava and lights underground.
